# THIS IS IMPORTANT!!!!!
In order to properly run the SDK and have everything work, you must have access to pvindex. If you do not have the permission/ability to access pvindex, you will not be able to run this repository.

If you DO have access to pvindex, you must run "npm run vendor" before making an executable as the repository does not come with the vendor files.

If you are simply running the appimage, you'll be fine. The vendor files have already been added.